  <h3>Java Implementation</h3>

  <p>The original Java implementation provides:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Excel-to-XML compilers for decision tables</li>
    <li>Full IDE support and debugging</li>
    <li>Comprehensive test harness</li>
    <li>Production-proven stability</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Go Implementation</h3>

  <p>The Go implementation provides:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Full compatibility</strong> with Java DTRules XML formats</li>
    <li><strong>High performance</strong>: 130x faster operator lookup, 24x faster arithmetic</li>
    <li><strong>Zero-allocation</strong> hot paths for reduced GC pressure</li>
    <li><strong>CLI tool</strong> for rule validation and execution</li>
  </ul>

